# 15. Governance

Create a **Latin America Launch Council** with representatives from:

- Regional general management;
- Brand and creative;
- E-commerce;
- Marketplaces;
- Supply chain;
- Regulatory and quality;
- Legal;
- Tax;
- Finance;
- Customer service;
